  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.11: Author-period portfolios now reuse exact first-parent repository evidence for analyzer-neutral C# lineage edits and use storage-aware Git scheduling with server GC. On the prepared 512-change checkpoint, median runtime fell from 11.399 to 6.279 seconds with identical estimate semantics, lower allocation, and lower sampled peak working set; results are fixture-specific and general core scaling is not established. Git child-process CPU telemetry is now best-effort across platforms. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.11/CHANGELOG.md",
